  "reason": "The only multimodal result so far (config_031) is the best configuration, but it is based on a single experiment and uses weighted fusion. RNA-only results show scvi_n200 with multiprofile is strong, while image-only models are weak, so it is unclear whether the multimodal gain comes from image information generally or specifically from weighted fusion. config_030 keeps the same model, profile, encoders, and aggregation as config_031 but changes only fusion from weighted to concat, isolating the fusion effect. This is the most efficient next test because it clarifies whether the best multimodal result is robust before investing in more complex multimodal variants."
